<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oryx Energy raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oryx Energy raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded Oryx Energy Co to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.  </p>
<p>-- CS First Boston later said it raised Oryx's price target to $26 a share from $25 a share.</p>
<p>-- trimmed the 1997 earnings estimate to $1.12 a share from $1.15 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1998 earnings estimate to $0.75 a share from $0.62 a share.</p>
</text>
